# Source context and research material (4GB of client drops), not part of
# the shipped site. Lowercase matches the folder on disk: an uppercase
# pattern only matches here because macOS is case-insensitive, and would
# silently stop ignoring on a case-sensitive checkout.
contexts/

# Working docs stay local: the repo ships the site only. CLAUDE.md sits in
# the root because Claude Code reads it there; everything else is docs/.
# The whole directory is ignored, not just its .md files, so a stray asset
# dropped in there cannot slip into the deploy.
# content/ is exempted so phase-5 category content can be .md if needed.
docs/
*.md
!content/**/*.md

# Supplied originals: 2.4MB of raster logo sources that must not be
# committed or deployed. The exported variants in assets/brand/ ship.
# The *.pdf guard stays even though the brand PDFs now live in contexts/.
assets/brand/source/
assets/brand/*.pdf

# Same pattern for the industry photography: the supplied PNGs stay local,
# the compressed JPEGs beside them ship. Roughly halves what gets deployed.
assets/industry/source/

# Internal brand reference: quotes the Capillary Brand Guide, stays local.
# It lives in assets/brand/ with the material it documents; absolute paths
# mean it still serves correctly from that depth.
assets/brand/capillary-brand.html
style/pages/capillary-brand.css

# Supplied video masters. The NASCAR testimonial arrived as a 207MB
# QuickTime, and Cloudflare Pages refuses any single file over 25 MiB:
# the transcoded mp4 in assets/video/ ships, the master stays local.
# The leading slash anchors this to the repo root, so assets/video/*.mp4
# is untouched and still ships. The image patterns are the same guard:
# supplied artwork has been dropped in the root three times now, and a
# root-level png or jpg is never part of the site.
*.mov
/*.mp4
/*.png
/*.jpg

# Working scratch. scratch/ holds serve.py, the local preview server CLAUDE.md
# tells you to use: it lives in the repo so it survives a cleared temp dir, and
# is ignored because it is tooling and this repo deploys whatever it contains.
scratch/
_probe.html
_harness.html
_scroll.html
*.log

# OS / editor
*.code-workspace
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# Claude Code: local tooling config, not part of the shipped site
.claude/

# Local tooling
node_modules/
.wrangler/
.env
.env.*

# Retired homepage experiments (V2 dark, V3 colourful light). Archived
# 15 Sep once V1 was locked as the shipping direction: kept locally as a
# parts bin, never deployed.
archive/

# Page generator for the retail category pages. The content it reads
# (content/retail/*.json) ships; the script that stamps it into HTML is
# build tooling, and this repo deploys whatever it contains.
tools/
